#: 8af7a1e447114b0f8935d204c21b227e 9e5366e57ce94e5193f96a35aae2ce87
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:99
#: 05d89b0578aa46e5ad4916922f81177a 20ee6575590343f084af55921d0f00b3
#: 5687f3dbc23d4654a10abb19b37e6722 8e0b0560e92e4a24beeba3891b574163
#: faecdc27996f417abc02460409a258aa fefbb1fb8fda4c5f88468e75f4f98319
msgid ""
"The SBUS pin, is passed by an inverter to R2 (UART2 RX), which by default is"
" mapped to a timer input instead of the UART, and can be used for all "
"ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which "
"require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"SBUS 引脚经反相器传递至 R2（UART2 RX），默认映射为定时器输入而非 UART，支持所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 "
"CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（这两种协议需要真正的 UART 连接）。但是，FPort 以此方式连接时仅能提供 RC 信号，不含数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:101
#: 43ad89bea6a547f4b84a6c9f6355e01b 8376285761674e99b7da596353ee8075
#: cc40b16091574ab3820d55b28c940397 d1d9fc1e281742029feb3d82d4e5ec43
#: d8e419bfa7e04c3a858e3eb19ffe829f e9be10c9d38d41f396b33f8071ea67f2
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, the R2 pin can also be configured to be used as true UART2 RX pin"
" for use with bi-directional systems by setting the "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to “1” so it becomes the SERIAL7 "
"port's RX input pin."
msgstr ""
"如需在 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中使用 CRSF 及内嵌数传，可将 R2 引脚配置为真正的 UART2 RX 引脚，将 "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设为 「1」，使其成为 SERIAL7 端口的 RX "
"输入引脚，从而支持双向系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-se.rst:103
