msgid ""
"this autopilot uses a high precision current sensor which is sensitive to "
"ESC switching noise. Be sure to use the bypass capacitor provided. In some "
"cases, the ESCs themselves will need additional 200-330uF low ESR capacitors"
" on their power inputs, if they do not incorporate them already. See `Matek "
"FAQs <http://www.mateksys.com/?p=5712#tab-id-12>`__ for more information."
msgstr ""
"此飞控使用高精度电流传感器，对 ESC 开关噪声较为敏感。请务必使用随附的旁路电容。在某些情况下，ESC 本身的电源输入端需要额外焊接 "
"200~330uF 低 ESR 电容（如果其本身未内置）。详情请参阅 `Matek FAQs "
"<http://www.mateksys.com/?p=5712#tab-id-12>`__。"

